WEBVTT

00:00:00.890 --> 00:00:01.780
Astounding!

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:02.730
Unprecedented!

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:03.900
Preposterous!

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:04.950
Earth shattering!

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:05.860
Unparalleled!

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:06.920
Indomitable!

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:07.820
Distress!

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:08.800
Agony!

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:09.800
Precarious future!

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:10.740
Ostensible!

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:11.760
Impregnable!

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:12.780
Fatigue!

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:13.890
Dire straits!

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:15.090
Despair!

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:15.840
Public nuisance!

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:16.990
Technicolour!

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:17.940
Hard struggle!

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:18.480
Coming soon!

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:21.960
For crying out loud, that's enough of those idiomatic phrases!

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.200
Are you not frustrated?

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.420
Not only has SoLaMi Smile already reformed,

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:30.970
they've also taken the Dream Theatre Unveiling Concert from us!

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:32.880
Of course I'm frustrated!

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:36.390
I want the three of us to sing together again.

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.970
It's all because Shion screwed up.

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:43.260
If you had just listened to me, we would have won.

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:44.880
What'd you say?!

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:47.160
It's because you jumped ahead on your own!

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:48.540
You're wrong.

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:51.020
It's because you were dragging us down!

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:55.150
R-Relax, you two, relax.

00:00:55.780 --> 00:01:00.290
Anyway, let's think of something
that will help us reform.

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:02.250
Good idea.

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:06.000
However, there's not much we can do without Usagi.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:10.250
For the time being, why don't we go look for two more members?

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:11.730
Okay!

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:15.430
I'll use my charm and scout us
a crazy awesome team member!

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:19.430
I'll do my best as well!

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.160
The 4th prophecy goes into effect now.

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:23.650
Ye best prepare yourselves.

00:01:25.070 --> 00:01:27.190
I'm starving!

00:01:27.190 --> 00:01:29.610
Here's a special spaghetti alle vongole bun.

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:34.400
It's scrumptious!

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:36.900
Ye best prepare yourselves.

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:10.800
Go! Farewell-usa?!

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:13.330
Capisce!

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:15.290
Pushuu~.

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:16.640
Pri!

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:19.670
1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7..

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:21.330
Brilliant. That's brilliant-kuma.

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:23.170
You're the best-kuma.

00:03:23.170 --> 00:03:24.800
You're shining-kuma!

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:29.020
Now that you've reformed, you're shining brighter and are more enthusiastic than ever-kuma!

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:31.600
It's tiring, yet still fun!

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:34.360
SoLaMi Smile has made a complete recovery-pri!

00:03:34.830 --> 00:03:36.570
Let's do another concert today-pri!

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:37.900
I'm in!

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.780
Let's!

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:41.030
Okay!

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:44.770
And while we're at it, let's jump up the rankings and become Divine Idols!

00:03:44.770 --> 00:03:46.380
It's true-usa.

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:50.320
The curse had no effect on Kuma-usa!

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:52.480
Was the curse a lie-usa?!

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:53.540
But...

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:55.040
<i>Neko...</i>

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:57.890
Was Neko-neesan lying?

00:03:57.890 --> 00:03:59.550
There's no way-usa!

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:03.250
But, seeing Kuma like that...

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:05.510
I'm so confused-usa!

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:09.370
You've always been my Go rival up until now, Iroha.

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:12.230
Therefore I think you'd be an exceptionally strong ally.

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:15.190
Form a Dream Team with us.

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:18.150
I humbly...

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:21.240
...refuse.

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:22.660
What?!

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:27.070
I am your rival through and through.

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:30.660
I will not team up with you until I defeat you.

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:32.280
Until we meet again.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.720
I see.

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:36.880
You truly are my rival.

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:39.510
I await our next battle!

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:41.340
But of course,

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:43.300
I'll be the winner.

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:47.850
This isn't a laughing matter!

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:50.240
I should continue looking.

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:52.100
Hello-nano!

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:54.630
Mikan?

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:56.270
Gelrun!

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:59.830
You're always super cool, Shion-chan!

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:02.610
I really want you to join Alomagedon!

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:05.440
You want me on your team?

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:06.960
Sorry, but I refuse.

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:11.580
I'm trying to reform Dressing Parfait.

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:15.410
Dorthy-chan is joining us as well.

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:16.290
What?

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:17.750
Dorthy is?!

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:20.090
That's what Aloma said.

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:23.570
Please think it over.

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:26.130
May the heavens bless you.

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:27.590
Bye-bye-nano!

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:32.060
Has Dorthy really...?

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:35.690
The two of you are also Major ranked, aren't you?

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:38.480
It'd be great if you two joined our team.

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:42.910
We're roses that can no longer be sold separately-mew.

00:05:42.910 --> 00:05:45.360
Our bond is stronger than that of twins-new.

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:48.240
If you'd like to be partners, there are two openings below us-new.

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:49.670
What?!

00:05:49.670 --> 00:05:53.450
As if I want to be part of such a lame getup.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:54.980
Lame-mew?!

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:57.160
It's part of our soul-new!

00:05:58.890 --> 00:06:03.630
And here I thought I'd offer my help to those who just happened to be good enough to become...

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.560
...Major ranked idols after ten years of PriPara.

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:07.740
How rude-new!

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:09.890
We're done here-mew.

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:15.790
And here I was inviting them nicely.

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:19.770
Now that it's come to this, I guess it's time to let loose the killer max beam!

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:21.730
Dorthy West.

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:25.190
As I thought, you are a hellion.

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:27.650
It's the demon idol!

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:31.740
Join our team and baptise Pripara in darkness.

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.010
What?

00:06:33.010 --> 00:06:34.500
What nonsense are you spouting?

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:35.490
Oh!

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:37.120
If you want to partner with us,

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:39.500
then why don't you join Dressing Parfait?

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:43.050
Only Dorthy and Shion are disciples of hell.

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:47.210
I have no use for the timid, plain, and always smiling Leona.

00:06:48.230 --> 00:06:50.930
Don't bad mouth Leona, you fake demon!

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:54.540
As if there's anyone who would join your team!

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:56.140
<i>Curses!</i>

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:58.260
<i>She really pisses me off! </i>

00:06:58.260 --> 00:07:02.540
<i>However, this makes me want this imp even more!</i>

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:04.620
What a splendidly foul mouth you have.

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:06.860
You truly are my kin.

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:09.750
Shion has already become my servant.

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:10.760
What?!

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:13.070
Shion already joined your team?!

00:07:14.060 --> 00:07:16.450
You'd do well to think it over.

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:19.210
Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:23.380
Devidevi Devil!

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:27.340
How dare you, Shion!

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:31.050
Hooray! I got Leona's autograph!

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:34.510
I can't wait to see Dressing Parfait on stage again!

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:37.600
Yeah, if you say so.

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:38.820
All right then, thanks!

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:40.230
Oh, hold on!

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:40.710
We're looking for new teammates...

00:07:40.710 --> 00:07:43.110
You got her autograph, isn't that great?

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:44.780
Yeah! I'm really happy!

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:47.250
It's kind of hard to find people.

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:52.870
Leona, have you seen Shion?

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:53.850
Huh?

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:54.900
No.

00:07:54.900 --> 00:07:56.930
I haven't seen her...

00:07:56.930 --> 00:07:59.210
But what's with that getup?

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:01.000
Is there something you need?

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:03.540
Shion!

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.260
I heard about it!

00:08:05.260 --> 00:08:07.750
What's this about joining that demon and angel's team?

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:08.590
Huh?!

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:10.300
You traitor!

00:08:11.810 --> 00:08:13.220
That's my line!

00:08:14.350 --> 00:08:17.460
So you've joined their team, huh?

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:18.050
Huh?

00:08:18.050 --> 00:08:19.640
Just who are you calling a traitor?!

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:21.290
What?!

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:22.270
You, of course!

00:08:22.590 --> 00:08:23.850
No, you!

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:27.020
Calm down you two!

00:08:27.620 --> 00:08:30.740
You're always acting so high and mighty.

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:33.310
You're stubborn and never listen to other people's opinions!

00:08:33.310 --> 00:08:36.240
How about you do something about that sharp tongue of yours?

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:39.240
Each and every word of yours is like a thorn!

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:41.450
Go idols are out of fashion!

00:08:42.340 --> 00:08:44.330
As is your use of the word "go"!

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:47.170
As always, you have no appeal!

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:48.040
What?!

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:49.750
This is your end!

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:54.880
You monochrome samurai!

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:56.470
Shut it, you foul-mouthed mushroom!

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:58.430
Stop it!

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:03.970
I'm lost-usa. Hopelessly lost-usa.

00:09:05.030 --> 00:09:07.520
Didn't she use these to read our fortune?

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:11.940
It's true! The curse really is true-usa!

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:14.900
No!

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:16.350
Huh?

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:17.110
Usa?

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:18.620
What?!

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:20.660
She just taped a picture to the back of it?!

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:24.420
Was it really a farce-usa?

00:09:24.420 --> 00:09:25.700
It's true-kuma.

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:29.590
We've been had by Neko-neesan-kuma.

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:31.550
Usa!

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:36.970
I won't forgive her for toying with my pure manly heart-usa!

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:39.680
Exactly-kuma.

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:42.470
Now then, let's thoroughly interrogate her,

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:45.430
and find out why she lied to us-kuma!

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:47.280
Hey you!

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:50.360
How dare you trick us-usa!
How dare you trick us-kuma!

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:53.080
There's no way I'll forgive you-usa!

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:55.400
Nekon.

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:57.660
Neko-neesan, what's wrong-kuma?!

00:09:57.660 --> 00:09:59.030
Did something happen-usa?!

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:00.600
Tell us everything-kuma!

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:02.240
We're here for you-usa!

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:05.290
I'm sorry-nekon.

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:08.790
I lied to both of you-nekon.

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:10.760
Neko-neesan!

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:12.250
But... why?

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:16.220
I want to be mean to the person I like-nekon.

00:10:17.060 --> 00:10:19.490
I hope you can understand...

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:21.930
...a woman's wavering heart-nekon?

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:26.340
When you say "person you like",
do you mean me-kuma?

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:28.480
No, she obviously means me, right-usa?

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:29.860
No, me-kuma!

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:30.900
Me-usa!

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:33.280
Neko.

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:40.390
Anyway, now I know there is no curse.

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:42.830
With this, we can happily reform-usa.

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:47.050
Let's start the ritual-usa!

00:10:47.050 --> 00:10:47.750
Hmph!

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:48.500
Usa?

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.820
Dressing Parfait is dead.

00:10:50.820 --> 00:10:52.730
I won't team up with Dorthy.

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:55.960
Teaming up with Shion would be
like teaming up with a pancake.

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:57.420
Huh?

00:10:58.460 --> 00:11:00.510
W-What happened-usa?!

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:03.640
It might be impossible for us to get back together now.

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:05.930
Usa?!

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:07.320
What?!

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:09.350
Shion-san and Dorthy-san did?!

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:12.310
They said that they won't reform.

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:16.980
Even Leona, the one who normally stops them,
doesn't know what to do this time.

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:20.870
I don't have anyone to rely on other than the three of you-usa.

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:24.270
Usagi-san's ears are drooping.

00:11:24.270 --> 00:11:26.290
I wonder what happened.

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:28.750
Anyway, let's go find out what's going on.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:32.970
Dorthy-san betrayed the team?

00:11:32.970 --> 00:11:35.000
I never thought she would.

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:37.370
Couldn't this be a misunderstanding?

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:38.980
That's not all.

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:41.570
I've been tolerating it up to now,

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:43.970
but she always needs to get in one more word and it's getting on my nerves!

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:46.930
This was the last straw.

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:48.330
But...

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:49.920
You're unwelcome here.

00:11:49.920 --> 00:11:51.500
This conversation is over.

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:55.170
Why would I apologise?

00:11:55.170 --> 00:11:56.610
This isn't a joke!

00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:59.380
Shion's the one who messed it all up.

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:02.060
There's no way Shion-san would betray you.

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:04.070
I'm sure you understand that, Dorthy-san!

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:07.590
Shion has always irritated me to the max.

00:12:07.590 --> 00:12:09.040
Always looking down on us.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:11.590
<i>So do you...</i>

00:12:13.060 --> 00:12:16.000
I thought this was just another one of their arguments,

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:19.050
but they won't listen to anything I say.

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:21.020
If you don't find a way to get through to them,

00:12:21.020 --> 00:12:24.100
Dressing Parfait really will crumble.

00:12:24.100 --> 00:12:27.910
Even if you say that, if I fail...

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:31.060
There's nothing that can get them to reform.

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:34.300
Are you okay with that, Leona-chan?

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:49.090
This is a bit much...

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:51.420
What a sour atmosphere-pri.

00:12:51.420 --> 00:12:54.060
Come on girls, don't turn your backs to each other!

00:12:54.060 --> 00:12:55.570
Let's talk this out!

00:12:57.510 --> 00:13:01.180
Hey, look at me! I'm a snail!

00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:03.690
I'm a gorilla!

00:13:03.690 --> 00:13:07.550
Ribbit, ribbit! I'm a frog-ribbit!

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:14.640
That's enough. Quit being so stubborn-pri!

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:17.440
Do you really want to stay disbanded forever-pri?!

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:18.650
There's no helping it.

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:20.360
There's no getting over it!

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:22.610
Poor Leona-chan...

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:29.240
It wasn't my intention to be mean to Leona...

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:32.450
I'm sure Leona understands my feelings.

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:34.780
This has to be a misunderstanding!

00:13:34.780 --> 00:13:36.830
I'm going to call Leona.

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:37.790
Lala...

00:13:39.530 --> 00:13:40.710
1,

00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:42.170
2,

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.130
3,

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:45.460
4...

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:46.090
Found her!

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:52.230
Leona, are you okay?!

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:55.700
O-Ouch.

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:58.370
Did you sprain your ankle?!

00:13:58.370 --> 00:13:59.980
You shouldn't push yourself that hard!

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:02.640
If I put even more effort into it,

00:14:02.640 --> 00:14:05.240
I'm sure Shion and Dorthy will...

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:08.160
Leona...?

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:12.450
Lala, what is it-kuma?

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:14.700
Leona is going to do a solo concert!

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:20.630
She's going to do it even though she sprained her ankle.

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:23.550
Please come over here, and quick!

00:14:24.390 --> 00:14:27.770
Would you like to enter without a manager?

00:14:27.770 --> 00:14:28.630
Yes.

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:31.590
Will you be okay with that sprained ankle?

00:14:31.590 --> 00:14:33.810
U-Uh... Yes.

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:35.600
Leona!

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:37.230
Are you okay?!

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:40.060
What's the meaning behind this solo concert-usa?!

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:42.860
I promised...

00:14:43.310 --> 00:14:46.070
...to put on a concert for our fans.

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:49.320
But you're injured!

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:50.540
You need to rest.

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:52.030
I-I won't!

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:55.740
After all, it's my concert!

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:57.900
It's impossible with an injury like that.

00:14:57.900 --> 00:14:59.460
You should rest!

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:01.970
I said I'm doing it...

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:02.840
So I'm doing it!

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:03.790
But!

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:05.250
I'm doing it!

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:07.500
Why are you so stubborn all of sudden?!

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:09.340
Listen to other's opinions once in a while!

00:15:10.530 --> 00:15:12.750
<i>You're always acting so high and mighty!</i>

00:15:12.750 --> 00:15:15.130
<i>You're stubborn and never listen to other people's opinions!</i>

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:19.180
Don't do it, Leona.

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:21.400
Go rest, I'll do it.

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:22.860
No.

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:27.150
All you do is fight, so I can't
leave it to someone like you.

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:29.490
Why would you say something so mean?!

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:33.200
How about you do something about that sharp tongue of yours?

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:35.440
Each and every word of yours is like a thorn!

00:15:45.530 --> 00:15:47.380
I get it.

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:51.510
I'd like to help, so do you mind if we do the concert together?

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:55.850
I also want to help...

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:04.310
We're sorry.

00:16:05.300 --> 00:16:07.690
Please let us be a three-person team again.

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:13.410
Hooray!

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:15.970
Don't overdo it!

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:20.630
I was so happy, I forgot I sprained my ankle.

00:16:20.630 --> 00:16:22.250
Are you sure you're okay?

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:25.040
Use this to numb it instantly-usa.

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.360
With this secret remedy,

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:28.960
I'm sure you'll be able to handle one concert-usa.

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:30.000
Yeah.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.420
Usagi!

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:33.600
I'm so happy.

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:37.870
I wouldn't want to perform without both of you.

00:16:38.670 --> 00:16:42.640
After all, I don't have Shion's stubbornness or confidence,

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:47.400
or Dorthy's unyielding spirit.

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:51.560
But, if the three of us are together,
we can go anywhere!

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:56.490
Let's turn over a new leaf with Dressing Parfait's reformation!

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:57.740
Yeah!

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:01.910
Now that it's been decided,
let's get on with the ritual-usa!

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:05.620
Though, I don't think there's any
helping Shion's stubbornness.

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:08.140
I'm so happy!

00:17:08.140 --> 00:17:10.290
They've finally made up-pri.

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:15.010
Promise: Believe in friendship.

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:17.010
Rhythm: Carved in our hearts.

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:19.700
Paradise: Our goal.

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:22.720
We swear to stand on stage as one.

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:28.200
Please scan the appropriate number
of My Tickets for your coord.

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:32.110
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:17:32.590 --> 00:17:34.470
Coord Change Start!

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:38.930
To commemorate your reformation,

00:17:38.930 --> 00:17:42.730
a tight-fitting rock style jacket has been mixed in to form a new coord.

00:17:42.730 --> 00:17:44.660
Rock Style Lady Coord!

00:17:45.190 --> 00:17:46.290
Go!

00:17:48.260 --> 00:17:52.900
The abundant shiny fabric glitters brightly!

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:55.050
Rock Style Lady Coord!

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:56.800
Yay!

00:17:58.230 --> 00:18:03.140
It's been boldly designed with a fashionable pattern sporting Dressing Parfait's logo!

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:05.640
Rock Style Lady Coord!

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:14.710
Dressing Parfait!

00:18:14.710 --> 00:18:15.860
We've been waiting for this!

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:16.650
Fight!

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:17.570
Do your best-pri!
Fight!

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:18.520
Go get 'em!
Do your best-pri!

00:18:18.520 --> 00:18:19.700
Go get 'em!

00:18:20.400 --> 00:18:22.660
We're singing together again!

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:25.620
This is how it should be!

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:28.490
Let's be a team forever!

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:56.880
Even if I can't do it alone...

00:18:56.880 --> 00:19:02.050
As long as we're together...

00:19:02.050 --> 00:19:03.930
We can go anywhere!

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:27.850
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:37.890
For our dreams! Dressing Parfait Full-Speed Dash!

00:19:37.890 --> 00:19:40.540
All Out Full-Speed Dash!

00:19:40.540 --> 00:19:44.060
Tension Max Full-Speed Dash!

00:19:44.060 --> 00:19:46.480
Fly, balloon!

00:19:47.270 --> 00:19:49.010
Relax!

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:55.470
Cyalume Change!

00:20:01.020 --> 00:20:02.380
Go!

00:20:18.350 --> 00:20:19.770
Purple is cool.

00:20:19.770 --> 00:20:21.280
So I got the same as Sophie.

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:24.030
We got blue, so we're pop!

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:25.660
The same as Mirelle.

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:29.260
Congratulations on your reformation.

00:20:29.260 --> 00:20:33.370
Now go find two more and assemble a Dream Team!

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:40.050
Those fools.

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:44.510
That was cool!

00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:47.470
Dressing Parfait has finally reformed.

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:50.010
We'll need to do our best, too!

00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:50.930
Yeah.

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:55.560
Though, Aloma-chan and Mikan-chan are really strange.

00:20:55.560 --> 00:20:58.140
I wonder what they're normally like?

00:20:58.140 --> 00:21:00.900
Your prophecy didn't go as expected.

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:06.080
Both SoLaMi Smile and Dressing Parfait have reformed.

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:08.500
Time to put the 5th prophecy into effect.

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.860
Chapter 6, section 606:

00:21:10.860 --> 00:21:16.330
"Starting today, we shall show ourselves to the human world for the sake of the final judgement."

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:17.380
Huh?

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:18.710
That voice...

00:21:22.620 --> 00:21:24.760
Aloma-chan? Mikan-chan?

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:29.390
With that outfit, does that mean...?!

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:30.220
Gel!

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:32.930
You're students at Paprika Primary Academy?!

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:33.800
Devi...

00:23:06.430 --> 00:23:09.880
Aloma-chan and Mikan-chan are
students at Paprika Academy?!

00:23:09.880 --> 00:23:12.500
On on top of that, they're also 6th graders?!

00:23:12.500 --> 00:23:14.990
The prophesy has reached a new page.

00:23:14.990 --> 00:23:17.750
We shall henceforth rule this school.

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:18.810
Amazing!

00:23:18.810 --> 00:23:20.580
The angel and demon's broom is...

00:23:20.580 --> 00:23:22.540
SoLaMi Smile, Dressing Parfait,

00:23:22.540 --> 00:23:24.670
will you join my kin or not?!

00:23:24.670 --> 00:23:26.990
If you join our team, you'll be saved!

00:23:26.990 --> 00:23:29.040
First come, first served...

00:23:29.040 --> 00:23:29.810
Next time:

00:23:29.810 --> 00:23:31.870
The Devil in the Next Class-nano.

00:23:31.870 --> 00:23:33.250
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:33.250 --> 00:23:34.800
Let's go PriPara!
